{
    "8": {
        "lines": [
            "　　This is the Ruby's Dark Kingdom. The capital of halloween country.",
            "    A place outside the human world where all The Urban Legends from our world coexists.",
            "    This place is ruled by Ruby Alinsky, The overlord of destruction.",
            "    A girl a bit too full of herself."
        ]
    },
    "13": {
        "lines": [
            "　　The blood moon that once showered Halloween not so long ago has stopped.",
            "　　Everything has gotten back to normal in the land of terror.",
            "    And Ruby Returned back to her Mansion In halloween."
        ]
    },
    "18": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"And that's how I kicked makai's overlord ass!\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Cool, isn't it?\"",
        ]
    },
    "22": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Well Sis, You got something big to brag for a long time.\""
        ]
    },
    "26": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"Totally. Ah, if only it reached more holidays...\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"everyone would be praising me for rescuing them!\""
        ]
    },
    "30": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"Ah...That would've been awesome...\""
        ]
    },
    "33": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Hehe, More people to adore ya, that's for sure.\""
        ]
    },
    "37": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$???????:$12345678> \"Hello There.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> You two still seem worried.\""
        ]
    },
    "41": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"You!?\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Why the hell are you in here!?\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Go to hell!\""
        ]
    },
    "44": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Don't be so rude! I just wanted to check on you...",
            "<c$$12345678\"> And to see if you actually have candies.\""
        ]
    },
    "48": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"Mistress Kuri wanted candies too bad today. She's even tired of Makai food.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> So, we flought all the way up here.\""
        ]
    },
    "52": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"Did you two really flought all the way from makai to here just for candy!?\""
        ]
    },
    "55": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"I swear! I've heard that halloween country candy is super good and special!\""
        ]
    },
    "59": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"It is. I just think Overlord Ruby simply doesn't like you.\""
        ]
    },
    "62": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"Ugh...She's so spoiled, making her vassal come even here.\""
        ]
    },
    "65": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"We'll probably give later. But only I swear if you two try something...\""
        ]
    },
    "68": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"We won't. Kuri doesn't wanna mess up with you and halloween country anymore.\""
        ]
    },
    "71": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"Not only with me but with all holidays too, eh?\""
        ]
    },
    "74": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"Hmmmmm...I don't know about that.\""
        ]
    },
    "77": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"I got better things to do now that I think about it.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Damelie and me were thinking about making a giant halloween party in makai.\""
        ]
    },
    "81": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"That's why we're here for candy. We will take as much as possible.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> I you girls don't mind, Of course.",
        ]
    },
    "84": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Ruby:$12345678> \"So you two are here only to get our candies and make your own halloween party?\""
        ]
    },
    "87": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Yep! Correct.\""
        ]
    },
    "90": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"That's better than opening a giant black hole and sucking everything. That's for sure.\"",
        ]
    },
    "93": {
        "lines": [
            "　　In the end...The fake moon sucking holidays into makai was closed and destroyed.",
            "　　Making everyone in halloween country going back to their normal sense.",
            "　　Before anything could go worse for the other holidays."
        ]
    },
    "97": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Christmas, Valentines, Easter etc...were mostly unharmed.",
            "　　And of course, Halloween went back to their prime at octobers."
        ]
    },
    "101": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Good Ending No. 1",
            "   \"A lovely visit from the Makai.\"",
        ]
    }
}